...had asked for permission to take Tsubasa with him to a football school in Brazil.

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,670
Tsubasa was undecided.

9
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:32,380
In the end, he decided to go to Brazil.

10
