36
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:13,070
Episode 10
Kojiro Arrives

37
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:13,070
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

38
00:02:12,610 --> 00:02:13,820
I'm leaving it to you!

39
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:14,530
Stop them!

40
00:02:14,530 --> 00:02:16,940
Just taking the ball from Hyuga is enough!

41
00:02:16,940 --> 00:02:17,990
Okay!

42
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:23,950
Did you think you could stop me with your weak defense?!

43
00:02:23,950 --> 00:02:25,830
If you want to stop me...

44
00:02:25,830 --> 00:02:27,540
...you have to put your life on the line!

45
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:30,210
I won't let you dribble any further!

46
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:32,460
How's that?

47
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:35,550
Shoot!

48
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:42,720
Hyuga Kojiro, you're a terrifying person!

49
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:43,930
You're exaggerating.

50
00:02:43,930 --> 00:02:46,680
How many people do you intend to injure?

51
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,850
Shut up!

52
00:02:47,850 --> 00:02:51,020
If injuries like this scare you, then quit football!

53
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:52,360
You--

54
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:56,030
Besides, this is a practice match before the regional tournament.

55
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:58,860
We can't afford any more injuries.

56
00:02:58,860 --> 00:03:00,780
The match ends here!

57
00:03:03,530 --> 00:03:05,790
Captain!

58
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:07,870
Didn't you go a bit too far today?

59
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:09,250
What did you say?

60
00:03:09,250 --> 00:03:11,540
Are you criticizing me too?

61
00:03:15,130 --> 00:03:16,420
Alright.

62
00:03:16,420 --> 00:03:20,010
Then try to pass the qualifiers with your own football.

63
00:03:20,010 --> 00:03:21,010
What?!

64
00:03:21,010 --> 00:03:23,970
From now on, I won't play in the qualifying matches anymore.

65
00:03:23,970 --> 00:03:28,470
Let's see if you can manage to participate in the national tournament with your own talents.

66
00:03:28,470 --> 00:03:29,520
Captain...

67
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:35,230
We'll see whether my football, Hyuga Kojiro's, is right or your football is right...!

68
00:03:35,230 --> 00:03:37,690
...we'll see!

69
00:03:41,570 --> 00:03:42,320
Tsubasa!

70
00:03:45,370 --> 00:03:47,030
Nice shot, Tsubasa-kun!

71
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:49,250
Yes. Misaki-kun is next, right?

72
00:03:53,370 --> 00:03:55,460
Is this really for the best?

73
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:02,130
Captain, you'll set sail in 2 weeks.

74
00:04:02,130 --> 00:04:05,220
If I take Tsubasa with me to Brazil...

75
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:08,310
His mother will be left alone.

76
00:04:08,310 --> 00:04:12,180
And even though Tsubasa says he's ready to go to Brazil...

77
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:15,480
...won't leaving his family make him feel lonely?

78
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,490
Roberto!

79
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:19,230
What's wrong?

80
00:04:19,230 --> 00:04:20,440
You spaced out.

81
00:04:21,650 --> 00:04:24,110
Sorry. Shall we take a short break?

82
00:04:24,110 --> 00:04:25,200
- Sure.
- Okay.

83
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,450
What about Ishizaki-kun?

84
00:04:29,330 --> 00:04:30,700
Come on. What's wrong?

85
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:32,290
We just started.

86
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:37,130
Come on. What's wrong?

87
00:04:37,130 --> 00:04:39,210
You've got no strength left in your legs.

88
00:04:39,210 --> 00:04:42,590
Aren't you being a bit cruel?!

89
00:04:42,590 --> 00:04:45,010
Give me 5 minutes so I can catch my breath.

90
00:04:45,010 --> 00:04:48,350
Okay, but starting tomorrow there won't be any breaks.

91
00:04:48,350 --> 00:04:49,930
Are you some kind of devil, Manabu?!

92
00:04:49,930 --> 00:04:52,560
But you, Tsubasa, and Misaki...

93
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:55,600
...were selected for the 30-player selection team.

94
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:58,560
Don't you want to be among the final 15 selected?

95
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:01,820
Yes. Tsubasa and Misaki's spots seem guaranteed but...

96
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:03,740
...your case is a bit dicey, isn't it Ishizaki?

97
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:05,820
You really don't mince your words.

98
00:05:05,820 --> 00:05:09,370
Anyway. This is our way of supporting you.

99
00:05:09,370 --> 00:05:12,580
If you don't work hard, you won't make it to the nationals.

100
00:05:14,250 --> 00:05:15,330
I understand.

101
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,880
How nice it would be for the three of us to go.

102
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:21,880
Yes.

103
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:24,010
They're coming again!

104
00:05:24,010 --> 00:05:26,550
Defense! Stop them this time!

105
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,600
I did it!

106
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,810
You're in top form today.

107
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:42,430
This practice match isn't even a warm-up for the Nankatsu FC players.

108
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:45,990
He got past!

109
00:05:45,990 --> 00:05:46,570
Captain!

110
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:48,070
Tsubasa...

111
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:50,830
I'll become champion two times in a row while on the same team.

112
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,080
Come on!

113
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:52,830
Alright!

114
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:55,870
Not working!

115
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:57,750
We can't get past Wakabayashi!

116
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,260
The match is over.

117
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:05,840
I-I'm sorry.

118
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:16,430
Hey, isn't the Nankatsu FC club amazing?

119
00:06:16,430 --> 00:06:19,190
With players from Shutetsu and Tsubasa and Misaki...

120
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:21,270
...don't you think they'd win the national tournament?

121
00:06:21,270 --> 00:06:23,900
Yes, I really want to see that.

122
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:26,030
You can't be so sure.

123
00:06:26,030 --> 00:06:29,070
The level of the nationals is getting higher and higher.

124
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:32,910
That's right, you transferred to many different schools, didn't you?

125
00:06:32,910 --> 00:06:35,910
Take Kujiukuri FC from Shiba, for example.

126
00:06:35,910 --> 00:06:40,500
They practice on the beach every day, developing their legs and lower body.

127
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:42,590
That's why they never lose in running...

128
00:06:42,590 --> 00:06:44,670
...and are known for their endurance.

129
00:06:45,210 --> 00:06:48,970
The players of Naniwa FC from Osaka are tall...

130
00:06:48,970 --> 00:06:51,680
...and never lose aerial balls.

131
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:56,470
At Hakata FC from Fukuoka, everyone from adults to children are on the same team.

132
00:06:56,470 --> 00:06:58,180
Because they practice with older players...

133
00:06:58,180 --> 00:07:00,850
...they can put on a show that even embarrasses adults.

134
00:07:00,850 --> 00:07:04,020
Wow. There are so many teams.

135
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:06,980
But if we go to the national tournament...

136
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:10,490
...the strongest might be Meiwa FC.

137
00:07:10,910 --> 00:07:14,370
Their ace forward, Hyuga Kojiro...

138
00:07:14,370 --> 00:07:17,330
...is as talented as Tsubasa-kun.

139
00:07:17,330 --> 00:07:18,330
Are you serious?!

140
00:07:18,330 --> 00:07:19,660
Liar!

141
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:22,000
Tsubasa is someone who scored a goal against national tournament Wakabayashi...

142
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:24,420
...all by himself!

143
00:07:24,420 --> 00:07:26,340
All you need to know is...

144
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:31,180
...that Kojiro has a very different forward style from Tsubasa-kun.

145
00:07:31,590 --> 00:07:35,140
Meiwa FC... Hyuga Kojiro...

146
00:07:42,940 --> 00:07:45,440
Man... I can't take it anymore.

147
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,240
Wakabayashi-kun!

148
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,990
Were you heading home too?

149
00:07:53,910 --> 00:07:58,330
Ishizaki, why are only your clothes dirty?

150
00:07:58,330 --> 00:07:59,290
Shut up!

151
00:07:59,290 --> 00:08:02,290
I was doing special training to stay in the final 15 of the selection team!

152
00:08:02,290 --> 00:08:04,630
Though it's all going to be in vain.

153
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:06,340
What did you say?!

154
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:10,590
What's wrong?

155
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:13,930
Nothing.

156
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:23,890
I really want to meet Hyuga from Meiwa FC.

157
00:08:23,890 --> 00:08:26,770
He said he has a different style from you.

158
00:08:26,770 --> 00:08:28,940
So you're still special.

159
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:30,990
You're different from all the players in the world.

160
00:08:30,990 --> 00:08:31,650
Exactly.

161
00:08:32,950 --> 00:08:35,990
There are many different players in Brazil, right?

162
00:08:35,990 --> 00:08:37,700
When you go to Brazil...

163
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:40,620
...promise you won't return to Japan until you become a professional.

164
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:41,540
Okay!

165
00:08:41,540 --> 00:08:44,920
Still, I want to become a professional as fast as possible!

166
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:48,250
Then I can play football all day long!

167
00:08:48,250 --> 00:08:49,340
Slow down.

168
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:53,300
If you can't win the national tournament, you can't come with me.

169
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:55,590
Tsubasa, we agreed on that.

170
00:08:55,590 --> 00:08:56,930
Of course!

171
00:08:58,350 --> 00:09:00,770
Becoming a professional is hard.

172
00:09:04,690 --> 00:09:05,230
Watch.

173
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:14,360
With training, sooner or later your legs will become this strong.

174
00:09:16,110 --> 00:09:19,410
But it's still too early for you to do this.

175
00:09:19,410 --> 00:09:22,120
If a child with still-developing bones tries this...

176
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,160
...you could injure your precious legs.

177
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:25,870
Okay, I understand.

178
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:28,830
By the way, today Wakabayashi...

179
00:09:28,830 --> 00:09:32,340
It was as if he wasn't putting weight on his foot when walking today.

180
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:33,550
What?

181
00:09:35,630 --> 00:09:40,260
The first practice day of the Nankatsu Youth Football Club had finally come.

182
00:09:41,010 --> 00:09:45,180
From these 30 people, 15 would be selected as representatives to go to the national tournament.

183
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:49,900
From these 30 people, 15 would be selected as representatives to go to the national tournament.

184
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:50,900
Alright.

185
00:09:50,900 --> 00:09:52,900
Now we will play a match in two groups.

186
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:55,650
Since we have more players from Shutetsu...

187
00:09:55,650 --> 00:10:00,530
...one team will consist of players from Shutetsu Elementary.

188
00:10:00,530 --> 00:10:02,910
The rest will form a mixed team.

189
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:05,330
So we're up against Shutetsu?

190
00:10:05,330 --> 00:10:07,370
Our second encounter since the interschool tournament.

191
00:10:07,370 --> 00:10:08,500
Alright!

192
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:12,920
Let's win this match and all of us get into the final 15 representatives!

193
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:13,750
Okay!

194
00:10:19,970 --> 00:10:22,470
So the match is starting.

195
00:10:28,190 --> 00:10:29,060
Let's see...

196
00:10:29,690 --> 00:10:32,570
Shall I join in too?

197
00:10:32,570 --> 00:10:35,070
Alright, here we come, mixed team!

198
00:10:35,070 --> 00:10:36,360
We'll never lose!

199
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,860
We want to be in the final 15 too!

200
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:42,490
Pass! Pass and disrupt their tempo!

201
00:10:42,490 --> 00:10:44,580
Are you Wakabayashi?

202
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,960
Who are you?

203
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:50,970
Hyuga Kojiro from Meiwa FC!

204
00:10:50,970 --> 00:10:52,590
Hyuga Kojiro from Meiwa FC!

205
00:10:52,590 --> 00:10:55,090
Hyuga Kojiro?

206
00:10:55,090 --> 00:10:57,260
I challenge you, Wakabayashi!

207
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:58,090
What?

208
00:11:01,930 --> 00:11:03,890
Coach, look at that!

209
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:05,770
Kisugi!

210
00:11:05,770 --> 00:11:07,220
Okay, got it.

211
00:11:07,220 --> 00:11:07,850
Oh no!

212
00:11:07,850 --> 00:11:09,520
The first goal is Shutetsu's!

213
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:12,310
What?

214
00:11:14,650 --> 00:11:16,570
I'm coming, Shutetsu.

215
00:11:18,190 --> 00:11:19,820
Wakabayashi Genzo!

216
00:11:19,820 --> 00:11:20,990
Kojiro!

217
00:11:20,990 --> 00:11:21,610
What?

218
00:11:21,610 --> 00:11:22,820
What did you say, Misaki?

219
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:25,160
So he's from Meiwa FC?

220
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:26,580
Captain, this--

221
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:27,410
No problem.

222
00:11:27,410 --> 00:11:29,620
I accept his challenge.

223
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:32,330
Coach, is it okay?

224
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:37,090
So that's Hyuga Kojiro.

225
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,220
You bastard...

226
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:42,180
How dare you block my chance to score?

227
00:11:43,090 --> 00:11:44,720
Move!

228
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:46,140
Are you kidding me?!

229
00:11:46,140 --> 00:11:47,970
Shutetsu! Let's go together and stop him!

230
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:56,020
He's heading directly for the goal.

231
00:11:56,020 --> 00:11:58,530
He's literally dribbling straight ahead.

232
00:11:58,530 --> 00:12:01,490
You're right. While you play technical football...

233
00:12:01,490 --> 00:12:03,360
...Kojiro plays with brute force.

234
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,320
What are you doing, Shutetsu?!

235
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:07,370
Take the ball from him, quick!

236
00:12:07,370 --> 00:12:08,790
Go, Takasugi.

237
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:11,160
You don't lose one-on-ones.

238
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:11,870
Okay.

239
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,260
You bastard!

240
00:12:19,260 --> 00:12:20,590
You hit him on purpose!

241
00:12:20,590 --> 00:12:21,800
Shut up!

242
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:25,050
My football is different from your gentle football.

243
00:12:26,430 --> 00:12:28,350
I'm coming, Wakabayashi!

244
00:12:28,350 --> 00:12:32,980
Let's test the skills of the prodigy goalkeeper!

245
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:36,310
Wakabayashi-kun, save it!

246
00:12:53,330 --> 00:12:56,920
So that's the skill of the so-called prodigy goalkeeper Wakabayashi?

247
00:12:56,920 --> 00:13:00,340
He couldn't even move a hair against my shot.

248
00:13:02,630 --> 00:13:03,970
Misaki-kun.

249
00:13:03,970 --> 00:13:06,840
It's better not to reveal your strength now, Tsubasa-kun.

250
00:13:10,470 --> 00:13:11,430
Misaki?

251
00:13:11,430 --> 00:13:12,890
Kojiro.

252
00:13:12,890 --> 00:13:15,140
It really is you, Misaki.

253
00:13:15,140 --> 00:13:18,940
What's up? Have you moved to this city now?

254
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:22,820
If you're a player on this team, let me tell you then.

255
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:24,950
This year's national tournament winner...

256
00:13:25,450 --> 00:13:27,950
...will be Meiwa FC.

257
00:13:27,950 --> 00:13:30,080
See you.

258
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:34,790
Kojiro, if you came here to do research...

259
00:13:34,790 --> 00:13:36,830
...you missed something.

260
00:13:37,580 --> 00:13:40,920
The person named Ozora Tsubasa on this team.

261
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:43,630
You left without knowing him.

262
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:45,470
Captain...

263
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:54,100
I can't believe it.

264
00:13:54,100 --> 00:13:57,770
How could Wakabayashi lose to someone other than Tsubasa?

265
00:13:57,770 --> 00:14:00,360
Afterwards, he went straight home.

266
00:14:02,110 --> 00:14:04,820
# Nakai Orthopedics #

267
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,110
Wakabayashi!

268
00:14:11,860 --> 00:14:17,530
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

269
00:14:17,790 --> 00:14:19,960
You found me at a bad time.

270
00:14:20,380 --> 00:14:22,880
Did you really injure your leg?

271
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:26,130
So that's why you couldn't react to that shot earlier.

272
00:14:26,130 --> 00:14:29,050
No. Even if I had reacted...

273
00:14:29,050 --> 00:14:30,720
...I'm not sure I could have saved it.

274
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:34,640
It was a truly powerful shot.

275
00:14:35,430 --> 00:14:39,350
Besides, I don't want to make excuses for losing.

276
00:14:39,350 --> 00:14:41,400
My injury is my own fault.

277
00:14:41,860 --> 00:14:45,440
Tsubasa, we will definitely go to the nationals.

278
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:47,990
Hyuga Kojiro will be there too.

279
00:14:47,990 --> 00:14:50,160
We'll make him pay for it then.

280
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,660
Yes.

281
00:15:10,590 --> 00:15:12,090
Good morning, Kojiro.

282
00:15:12,090 --> 00:15:15,060
Good morning. Aren't you going to work early?

283
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:17,480
Stop worrying about your mother already.

284
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:20,310
Go play the football you love.

285
00:15:21,100 --> 00:15:23,560
I'm doing this for football.

286
00:15:25,070 --> 00:15:29,530
Ever since my father died, my mother has been working multiple jobs.

287
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:32,570
I can't be the only one doing what I love.

288
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:36,330
Good morning. I came to help.

289
00:15:36,330 --> 00:15:38,790
I'm always causing you trouble. You're a great help.

290
00:15:38,790 --> 00:15:40,830
This is also part of my training.

291
00:15:42,710 --> 00:15:45,670
When I start middle school...

292
00:15:45,670 --> 00:15:48,090
...I'll need more money.

293
00:15:48,090 --> 00:15:51,260
And there are 3 more after me.

294
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:54,140
My little brothers and sister.

295
00:15:54,140 --> 00:15:56,140
Here. Today's reward.

296
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:57,930
Thank you very much!

297
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:01,600
I will change my life with football!

298
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:03,940
I will give my family a comfortable life!

299
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:07,530
For that, I must improve my football...

300
00:16:07,530 --> 00:16:09,690
...and participate in as big tournaments as possible.

301
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:14,700
I will definitely participate in the national tournaments too!

302
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:20,660
Brother, good morning.

303
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:22,830
Everyone's awake.

304
00:16:22,830 --> 00:16:24,880
Has our mom left?

305
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:27,960
Yes. I'll prepare breakfast for you right away.

306
00:16:31,550 --> 00:16:33,840
Your father will go on another journey today.

307
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:36,600
Since you've decided to go to Brazil...

308
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:41,020
...you probably won't be home when I return from the next voyage.

309
00:16:41,020 --> 00:16:41,850
Yes.

310
00:16:41,850 --> 00:16:46,520
Actually, we made a promise with Tsubasa about this, Captain.

311
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,820
A promise?

312
00:16:47,820 --> 00:16:50,320
Unless he wins the national tournament...

313
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:52,700
...he won't come to Brazil.

314
00:16:52,700 --> 00:16:54,860
That sounds a bit harsh.

315
00:16:54,860 --> 00:17:00,040
But one thing won't change. Tsubasa will definitely win the national tournaments.

316
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:01,750
Thanks, Dad.

317
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:05,250
Then make a promise to your father too, Tsubasa.

318
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:06,630
What?

319
00:17:06,630 --> 00:17:09,590
If you score a hat trick in today's match...

320
00:17:09,590 --> 00:17:12,130
...I'll allow you to go to Brazil.

321
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:15,590
You were the one who said to let him go in the first place.

322
00:17:15,590 --> 00:17:19,010
I want to see how serious Tsubasa is about going.

323
00:17:19,010 --> 00:17:22,770
I understand. I just need to score a hat trick, right?

324
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:26,020
Then I'll record this beautifully.

325
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:30,940
It will be Tsubasa's last tournament in Japan, right?

326
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:33,860
Captain!

327
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:36,200
Hyuga-san!

328
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:37,450
Please wait!

329
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:40,120
Are you really not participating in the regional tournament?

330
00:17:40,120 --> 00:17:45,040
Weren't you going to make it to the nationals with your own football?

331
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:48,880
See you. I'll be waiting for good news.

332
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:51,050
Make sure you win.

333
00:17:52,710 --> 00:17:55,050
He doesn't have to be so harsh.

334
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:58,180
No. We've relied on him too much up until now.

335
00:17:58,180 --> 00:18:02,310
Also, the captain has a reason that absolutely requires him to win.

336
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:02,970
A reason?

337
00:18:03,390 --> 00:18:07,100
Last year, the Captain lost his father.

338
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:10,560
He still has young siblings...

339
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:13,070
...and his mother works different jobs.

340
00:18:13,070 --> 00:18:16,610
In this situation, all the housework falls to the Captain.

341
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:21,910
That's why the Captain wants to win the nationals so professional teams will discover him.

342
00:18:21,910 --> 00:18:25,290
That way, he can help his mother sooner.

343
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:29,790
That's right. There are many talent scouts at the nationals, right?

344
00:18:29,790 --> 00:18:30,750
I understand.

345
00:18:30,750 --> 00:18:34,130
We must also do our best for our Captain!

346
00:18:34,130 --> 00:18:35,510
Yes!

347
00:18:36,970 --> 00:18:42,100
Across the entire country, the qualifiers for the national tournament had begun.

348
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:45,100
You were selected again.

349
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:48,020
Wakabayashi-kun, we'll start soon.

350
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:49,900
Yes. We're starting.

351
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:51,110
Is your leg okay?

352
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:54,110
It's okay, that's why I'm here.

353
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:57,240
The 3rd match of the first round is about to begin.

354
00:18:57,650 --> 00:19:01,740
Nankatsu FC and Fuji FC will face off.

355
00:19:02,070 --> 00:19:05,080
This is your first match. Give it everything you've got.

356
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,000
- Okay!
- Okay!

357
00:19:07,750 --> 00:19:10,370
So I'm a substitute?!

358
00:19:11,670 --> 00:19:14,840
Tsubasa, I came to support you.

359
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:16,010
Dad!

360
00:19:16,010 --> 00:19:18,260
Score that hat trick!

361
