Okay!

362
00:19:22,390 --> 00:19:26,060
Tsubasa-kun, come on!

363
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:29,390
The match starts with Nankatsu's kick-off.

364
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:32,650
Wait for me, nationals.

365
00:19:32,650 --> 00:19:35,650
I'll show everyone my talent.

366
00:19:35,650 --> 00:19:39,320
Then I can get a football scholarship at a football-based school.

367
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:42,910
That way, I can dedicate myself entirely to football!

368
00:19:43,570 --> 00:19:47,080
It went in! Nankatsu quickly scored a goal!

369
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,830
That's it! One!

370
00:19:48,830 --> 00:19:50,000
Yes.

371
00:19:50,870 --> 00:19:54,750
Exactly. You can only write your own destiny.

372
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,720
Nankatsu scores their 2nd goal!

373
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:08,680
This time Tsubasa-kun dribbled and scored the goal!

374
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:11,440
I was worried about my leg but...

375
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:14,310
...at this rate, they won't need my goalkeeping skills.

376
00:20:14,310 --> 00:20:16,610
Do your best!

377
00:20:14,690 --> 00:20:16,610
Come on, push Tsubasa!

378
00:20:16,610 --> 00:20:18,320
Keep it up!

379
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:19,820
Hold him! Surround him!

380
00:20:26,370 --> 00:20:29,870
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun are showing wonderful duo passing!

381
00:20:29,870 --> 00:20:32,370
Here's their combination play!

382
00:20:32,370 --> 00:20:35,790
He runs and fires a volley!

383
00:20:37,130 --> 00:20:39,090
The goalkeeper couldn't even move!

384
00:20:39,090 --> 00:20:42,630
Tsubasa-kun scored a hat trick early in the first half!

385
00:20:42,630 --> 00:20:44,510
I did it, Dad!

386
00:20:44,510 --> 00:20:48,970
Good. Your father will set sail on his favorite ship.

387
00:20:48,970 --> 00:20:54,520
You win the nationals, go to Brazil, and improve your football!

388
00:20:54,520 --> 00:20:57,520
Okay! Take care, Dad!

389
00:20:59,650 --> 00:21:00,860
Have a good voyage.

390
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:02,900
Yes. I will return.

